{"taxClaims":[{"text":"Regulations 26 and 27 generally disallow input tax on specified expenses, subject to the scope limits and exceptions in the regulations and IRAS guidance. Business purpose alone does not make a blocked claim recoverable.","recordId":"GST_REG26_BLOCKED_INPUT_TAX","quote":"Regulations 26 and 27 generally disallow input tax on specified expenses, subject to the scope limits and exceptions in the regulations and IRAS guidance. Business purpose alone does not make a blocked claim recoverable.","kind":"RULE"},{"text":"Subject to the conditions for input tax claim, these claims are allowed if you have the supporting tax invoice addressed to you or the simplified tax invoice if the purchase value (including GST) is not more than $1,000.","recordId":"LIVE_TOPIC_iras-gst-entertainment_c090bb2b4242","quote":"Subject to the conditions for input tax claim, these claims are allowed if you have the supporting tax invoice addressed to you or the simplified tax invoice if the purchase value (including GST) is not more than $1,000.","kind":"RULE"},{"text":"As an administrative concession, a receipt which contains all the information required in a simplified tax invoice can also be used to claim the input tax incurred for entertainment expenses exceeding $1,000 (including GST). You must also keep alternative documentary payment evidence and information on entertainment details (such as name of person entertained, purpose of entertainment, person incurring the expenses, etc.) to support your claim.","recordId":"LIVE_TOPIC_iras-gst-entertainment_c090bb2b4242","quote":"As an administrative concession, a receipt which contains all the information required in a simplified tax invoice can also be used to claim the input tax incurred for entertainment expenses exceeding $1,000 (including GST). You must also keep alternative documentary payment evidence and information on entertainment details (such as name of person entertained, purpose of entertainment, person incurring the expenses, etc.) to support your claim.","kind":"RULE"},{"text":"This concession is applicable only to expenses on food and drinks.","recordId":"LIVE_TOPIC_iras-gst-entertainment_c090bb2b4242","quote":"This concession is applicable only to expenses on food and drinks.","kind":"RULE"}],
 "treatment":"Financial accounting discussion only, if requested",
 "requiredAccounts":[]}

